{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--copula-requires-nominal-complement","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--clause-template"],"statement":{"en":"The copula ne cannot form a sentence on its own and requires a nominal complement.","ja":"繋辞 ne は単独で文を形成することはできず、名詞補語を必要とする。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"asserted","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0070-03","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0266-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--copula-with-ruwe-sentence-final","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--formal-noun-tail"],"statement":{"en":"The copula ne frequently combines with the nominalizer ruwe as ruwe ne to close sentences assertively or emphatically.","ja":"コピュラ ne は名詞化辞 ruwe と結びつき、ruwe ne として文末を断定的に結ぶ。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"frequent","modality":"asserted","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne","ruwe","ruwe ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0140-02","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0141-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--copula-static-and-dynamic-meanings","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--inchoative"],"statement":{"en":"Ainu does not distinguish between 'being' and 'becoming', and the meaning of the copula ne can be static as well as dynamic.","ja":"アイヌ語は「ある」ことと「なる」ことを区別せず、繋辞 ne の意味は静態的にも動態的にもなり得る。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"asserted","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0138-15","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0139-13","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--copula-negation-ka-hannehka","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--negation"],"statement":{"en":"The negative form of the copular construction in Sakhalin Ainu is marked by ka hannehka (nee), in which nee is frequently omitted.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語におけるコピュラ構文の否定形は ka hannehka (nee) で表され、nee は省略されることが多い。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"asserted","conditions":[]},"forms":["ka hannehka","nee"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0019-03","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0023-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--copula-takes-a-markers-not-o","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"The copular verb ne takes transitive subject (A-series) personal markers but never takes object (O-series) markers.","ja":"コピュラ動詞 ne は他動詞主語（A系列）の人称標識を取るが、目的語（O系列）の標識を取ることはない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"asserted","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2012@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0007-12","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2012@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0008-24","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2015@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0003-01","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:sato2023b@pdftotext-pieces/l0011-01","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:sato2025a@pdftotext-pieces/l0013-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--copula-prefixes-subject-markers-shizunai","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"In the Shizunai dialect, the copula ne prefixes nominative pronominal affixes but does not combine with objective affixes.","ja":"静内方言において、コピュラ ne は主格代名詞接辞を接頭するが、目的格接辞とは結合しない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"asserted","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0138-12","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0139-11","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"refines","claim":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--copula-takes-a-markers-not-o","differs_in":"dialect","note":"Shizunai-specific formulation framed in nominative/objective prefix terminology"}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copular-verb-nee-and-its-inflected-form","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--clause-template"],"statement":{"en":"The copular verb nee and its inflected form ku=nee are frequently omitted, in which case the sentence-final portion is spoken with a rising intonation.","ja":"指定動詞 nee および ku=nee はよく省略され、省略された場合は文末部分を上がりイントネーションをつけて言う。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["omitted nee"]},"forms":["nee","ku=nee"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0016-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copula-nee-can-be-omitted-by-pronouncing","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--clause-template"],"statement":{"en":"The copula nee can be omitted by pronouncing the preceding noun with a high pitch, resulting in a sentence ending in a noun.","ja":"指定を表す動詞（指定詞）nee は、その前の名詞を高い音調で言うことによって省略でき、その場合は名詞で文が終わる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"possible","conditions":["when the preceding noun is pronounced with high pitch"]},"forms":["nee"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0097-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--sentences-ending-directly-in-a-noun-are-basically","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--clause-template"],"statement":{"en":"Sentences ending directly in a noun are basically avoided in Ainu, and expressing 'A = B' requires the copular verb ne after the noun.","ja":"アイヌ語では名詞で終わる文は基本的に避けられ、A=Bの意味を表す際は名詞の後にコピュラ動詞neを置かなければならない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"necessary","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2022pos@handbook-epub/l0091-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-nominal-complement-of-the-copula-ne-may","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--clause-template"],"statement":{"en":"The nominal complement of the copula ne may be a noun expression, a noun modified by an adnominalized clause, or a nominalized sentence.","ja":"繋辞 ne の名詞補語は、名詞表現、連体修飾節によって修飾された名詞、あるいは名詞化された文のいずれかであり得る。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"possible","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0266-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-nominal-complement-of-the-copula-may-be","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--clause-template"],"statement":{"en":"The nominal complement of the copula may be accompanied by a restrictive postposition.","ja":"繋辞の名詞補語は限定後置詞を伴うことができる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"possible","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0266-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--when-the-subject-is-second-person-the-copula","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--clause-template"],"statement":{"en":"When the subject is second person, the copula ne appears even in a sentence containing hunna 'who', as in hunna e-ne? 'Who are you?'.","ja":"二人称が主語の場合には、hunna「誰」を含む文であっても hunna e-ne?「お前は誰だ？」のように ne「〜である」が現れる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["with second-person subject"]},"forms":["hunna","ne","e-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0157-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--in-content-questions-with-the-copula-ne-is","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--competing-analyses"],"statement":{"en":"In content questions with the copula, ne is often replaced by the existential verb an, and in evidential content questions it is obligatorily replaced by an.","ja":"コピュラを含む疑問詞疑問文では ne が存在動詞 an に置換されることが多く、証拠性節では義務的に an に置換される。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["content questions with copula or evidentials"]},"forms":["ne","an"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2012@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0020-15","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--an-originally-is-a-verb-meaning-there-is","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--competing-analyses"],"statement":{"en":"an originally is a verb meaning 'there is' (to exist), but when combined with the locative particle ta or tap (as ta-an or tap-an), it acquires the meaning 'is' and functions simply as a copula like the verb ne.","ja":"an は本来「がある」を意味する動詞であるが、処格助詞 ta または tap と結合すると「である」の意味になり、動詞 ne と同様に単に copula として用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["an","ta","tap","ta-an","tap-an","ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0196-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--in-short-questions-and-answers-where-ruwe-is","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--formal-noun-tail"],"statement":{"en":"In short questions and answers where ruwe is omitted, enta an ya and esta an ne assume the functions of both the copula and the sentence-final form, acting as an interrogative copula and an assertive copula respectively.","ja":"ruwe が省略された短い疑問文や返答において、enta an ya と esta an ne は繋辞と文末形式の双方の機能を兼ね備え、それぞれ一種の「疑問の繋辞」および「断定の繋辞」として機能する。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["in short questions and answers where the copula is the main verb and ruwe is dropped"]},"forms":["enta an ya","esta an ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0230-10","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--in-questions-using-the-nominalizer-ruwe-the-copula","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--formal-noun-tail"],"statement":{"en":"In questions using the nominalizer ruwe, the copula ne appears before ruwe, as in tanpe hemanta ne ruwe an? 'What is this?'.","ja":"名詞化辞 ruwe を用いた疑問文では、tanpe hemanta ne ruwe an? のように ne「〜である」が現れる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["in wh-questions with nominalizer ruwe"]},"forms":["ne","ruwe","an"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0157-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-morpheme-ne-is-the-copula-and-its","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--inchoative"],"statement":{"en":"The morpheme ne is the copula, and its meaning 'become' reflects the dynamic rather than static function of the copula.","ja":"形態素 ne は係辞（コピュラ）であり、その「〜になる」という意味は静態的機能に対して動態的機能を反映している。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0022-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-morpheme-ne-is-the-copula-and-its-2","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--inchoative"],"statement":{"en":"The morpheme ne is the copula, and its 'become' meaning reflects the dynamic, as opposed to the static, function of the copula.","ja":"形態素 ne は繋辞であり、その「〜になる」という意味は静態的機能に対置される繋辞の動態的機能を反映している。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0023-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copula-ne-can-have-an-inchoative-reading","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--inchoative"],"statement":{"en":"The copula ne can have an inchoative reading meaning 'to become X'.","ja":"繋辞 ne は「Xになる」を意味する起動相的な読みを持つことができる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"possible","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0019-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-translative-case-is-expressed-by-ne-which","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--mutative-ne"],"statement":{"en":"The translative case is expressed by ne, which is derived from the verb ne 'to become'.","ja":"化成格は「に成る」という意味の動詞に由来する ne によって表される。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0051-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-mutative-case-postposition-ne-denoting-the-result","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--mutative-ne"],"statement":{"en":"The mutative case postposition ne denoting the result of a change represents a derived dynamic use of the copula ne.","ja":"変化の結果を表す変合格後置詞 ne は、コピュラ ne の動態的な意味から派生した用法である。"},"type":"diachrony","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"possible","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0138-16","stance":"proposes"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-mutative-case-postposition-ne-denotes-the-result","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--mutative-ne"],"statement":{"en":"The mutative case postposition ne denotes the result of a change as a derived dynamic use of the copula ne.","ja":"変化格の後置詞 ne は、繋辞 ne の動態的用法の派生として変化の結果を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0139-14","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--ne-is-a-case-particle-marking-state-or","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--mutative-ne"],"statement":{"en":"ne is a case particle marking state or change ('as, into, at').","ja":"ne は状態や変化を表す格助詞である（「〜で、〜に」）。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0053-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--tapan-is-often-used-in-place-of-the","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--overview"],"statement":{"en":"tapan is often used in place of the verb ne in verse and formal expressions.","ja":"tapan は韻文など、改まった表現の場合に動詞 ne の代わりに使われることが多い。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":["in verse and formal registers"]},"forms":["tapan","ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0397-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copula-ne-expresses-both-be-and-become","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--semantic-readings"],"statement":{"en":"The copula ne expresses both 'be' and 'become'.","ja":"コピュラ ne 自体が「〜である」と「〜になる」という二つの意味を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0116-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--to-express-to-be-the-translative-case-particle","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--semantic-readings"],"statement":{"en":"To express 'to be', the translative case particle ne can be combined with the existential verb an as ne an.","ja":"「〜である」を表す場合、動詞 ne だけでも表せるが、転成格の ne と存在動詞 an を組み合わせて ne an とすることもある。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne an","ne","an"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0297-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copula-ne-expresses-the-equative-and-attributive","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--semantic-readings"],"statement":{"en":"The copula ne expresses the equative and attributive meanings of the copula.","ja":"コピュラ ne はコピュラの同一関係および属性叙述の意味を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0138-13","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copula-ne-does-not-cover-existential-or","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--semantic-readings"],"statement":{"en":"The copula ne does not cover existential or locative meanings of 'to be', which are instead expressed by the existential verb an (sg.) / oka (pl.).","ja":"コピュラ ne は存在や所在の意味を担わず、この機能は存在動詞 an（単数）/ oka（複数）によって担われる。"},"type":"absence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"none","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne","an","oka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0138-14","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copula-ne-expresses-the-equative-and-attributive-2","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--semantic-readings"],"statement":{"en":"The copula ne expresses the equative and attributive meanings of 'to be', but does not express existential or locative meanings, which are expressed by an (singular) and oka (plural).","ja":"繋辞 ne は「〜である」の同格的・属性的意味を表すが、存在や所在の意味は表さず、それらの機能は存在動詞 an（単数）/ oka（複数）が担う。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne","an","oka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0139-12","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--in-expressions-meaning-what-is-x-or-who","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--semantic-readings"],"statement":{"en":"In expressions meaning 'What is X?' or 'Who is X?' such as taanpe hemanta an? and toan kur hunna an?, the verb an is used rather than the copula ne, and sentences like *taanpe hemanta ne? or *toan kur hunna ne? have not been attested.","ja":"「これは何ですか？」や「彼は誰ですか？」に当たる表現（taanpe hemanta an?, toan kur hunna an? など）では指定詞 ne ではなく an が用いられ、*taanpe hemanta ne?, *toan kur hunna ne? のような例はこれまでのところ見つかっていない。"},"type":"absence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"none","modality":"actual","conditions":["third-person subject in simple equational wh-questions without ruwe"]},"forms":["an","ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0157-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-ainu-copula-ne-generally-requires-an-equational","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--semantic-readings"],"statement":{"en":"The Ainu copula ne generally requires an equational relationship between its subject and complement (where the complement must properly predicate an inherent property of the subject), and unlike Japanese -da, 'eel sentences' (unagi-bun) are not permitted except in figurative expressions.","ja":"アイヌ語のコピュラ ne「〜だ、〜である」は原則として主語と補語の間に等価的な関係を要求し、日本語の「〜だ」と異なり、比喩的表現を除いてはいわゆる「ウナギ文」は許されない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"necessary","conditions":["except in figurative expressions"]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0157-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-expressions-ne-hine-an-and-ne-wa","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--semantic-readings"],"statement":{"en":"The expressions ne hine an and ne wa an have no aspectual meaning.","ja":"ne hine an および ne wa an という表現にはアスペクト的な意味はない。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru","doculect:hokkaido/chitose"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne hine an","ne wa an"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:yoshikawa2022@handbook-epub/l0126-14","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copula-ne-be-become-is-regarded-as","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"The copula ne 'be, become' is regarded as a special kind of transitive verb because it takes A-series personal affixes but not O-series affixes.","ja":"繋辞ne「〜である、〜になる」は、A系列の他動詞主語人称接辞をとる一方でO系列の接辞をとらないため、アイヌ語文法において特殊な他動詞とみなされる。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2021poss@pdftotext-pieces/l0012-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--incomplete-intransitive-verbs-such-as-ne-to-become","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"Incomplete intransitive verbs, such as ne ('to become'), follow exactly the same subjective conjugation pattern as transitive verbs.","ja":"不完全自動詞（例えば「〜になる」を意味する動詞 ne）は、他動詞と全く同一の主格活用を行う。"},"type":"membership","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0089-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--when-the-third-person-plural-suffix-a-hci","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"When the third-person plural suffix -(a)hci attaches to the copula stem nee, the stem vowel shortens to ne=hci (*nee-hci becomes ne-hci).","ja":"三人称複数接辞 -(a)hci が指定動詞 nee に付くと、*nee-hci は長母音を短縮して ne=hci となる。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne=hci","nee"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0017-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--in-sakhalin-ainu-the-second-person-singular-copular","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"In Sakhalin Ainu, the second-person singular copular predicate 'you are...' is formed as 'e=nee.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語において、2人称単数の名詞述語「おまえ～だ」は'e=neeとなる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["'e=nee","'e=","nee"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0071-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--in-sakhalin-ainu-the-second-person-plural-copular","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"In Sakhalin Ainu, the second-person plural copular predicate 'you (pl.) are...' is formed as 'eci=nee.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語において、2人称複数の名詞述語「おまえたち～だ」は'eci=neeとなる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["'eci=nee","'eci=","nee"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0071-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--in-sakhalin-ainu-the-third-person-singular-copular","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"In Sakhalin Ainu, the third-person singular copular predicate 'he/she is...' is nee, without any person prefix.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語において、3人称単数のコピュラ述語「彼～だ」は人称接辞のないneeである。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["nee"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0073-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--in-sakhalin-ainu-the-third-person-plural-copular","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"In Sakhalin Ainu, the third-person plural copular predicate 'they are...' is formed as ne=hci.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語において、3人称複数のコピュラ述語「彼ら～だ」はne=hciとなる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne=hci","=hci"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0073-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copula-ne-to-be-is-treated-as","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"The copula ne ('to be') is treated as a subclass of two-argument verbs, but unlike other two-argument verbs, it never takes object personal affixes.","ja":"コピュラ ne は2項動詞の下位区分として扱われることがあるが、他の2項動詞と異なり目的格人称接辞をとることがない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0129-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copula-ne-cannot-take-any-verbal-prefixes","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"The copula ne cannot take any verbal prefixes or suffixes, but it may be followed by auxiliaries.","ja":"繋辞 ne は動詞の接頭辞や接尾辞を一切取ることができないが、助動詞を後続させることはできる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0140-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copula-ne-cannot-take-any-verbal-prefixes-2","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"The copula ne cannot take any verbal prefixes or suffixes.","ja":"コピュラ ne はいかなる動詞接頭辞や接尾辞も取ることができない。"},"type":"absence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"necessary","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0141-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copula-ne-may-be-followed-by-auxiliaries","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"The copula ne may be followed by auxiliaries.","ja":"コピュラ ne は助動詞を後続させることができる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"possible","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0141-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copula-ne-can-take-a-nominative-pronominal","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"The copula ne can take a nominative pronominal affix.","ja":"繋辞 ne は主格の代名詞接辞を取ることができる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"possible","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0266-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copula-ne-is-a-kind-of-verb","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"The copula 'ne' is a kind of verb, but because it conjugates differently from ordinary verbs and forms negative expressions differently, it is called a designator (or copula).","ja":"ne「〜だ，である」も動詞の一種だが，通常の動詞とは活用の仕方が異なり，否定表現の作り方も違ったりするので「指定詞」（コピュラ）と呼ぶ。"},"type":"terminology","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0038-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--when-the-copula-ne-incorporates-a-noun-e","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"When the copula ne incorporates a noun (e.g., inne 'many (people)' < ir-ne), its morphological valency decreases to 1 and the resulting verb undergoes intransitive personal inflection.","ja":"コピュラ動詞 ne が名詞を抱合した場合（例：inne「人数が多い」＜ ir-ne）、形態的結合価は1に減少し、生じた動詞は自動詞の人称変化を行う。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne","inne","ir-ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2023b@pdftotext-pieces/l0011-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copula-verb-ne-can-take-a-second","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"The copula verb ne can take a second-person independent pronoun as a complement without a corresponding second-person marker on the verb, though this pattern is rare.","ja":"繋辞動詞neは動詞上の人称一致を伴わずに2人称の独立代名詞を補語として取ることが稀にある。"},"type":"existence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"actual","conditions":["rare"]},"forms":["ne","eani"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2025a@pdftotext-pieces/l0013-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--the-copula-ne-takes-the-same-personal-affixes","revision":1,"topic":"topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topics":["topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals","topic:clause/copula-ne-predicate-nominals--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"The copula ne takes the same personal affixes as transitive verbs.","ja":"繋辞 ne は他動詞と同じ人称接辞をとる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0019-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
